OL,3,GNEWSAEverton fans condemn 'death camp'
OL,4,Acomments in station row
OL,5,
OL,6,FEverton Fan Advisory Board has urged
OL,7,FLiverpool Council to stop using the
OL,8,Fclub as a "political football" after a
OL,9,Fdebate around improvement to Sandhills
OL,10,Fstation led to comparisons to Nazi
OL,11,FGermany.
OL,13,FDuring a planning meeting this week,
OL,14,FLiberal Democrat councillor Pat Moloney
OL,15,Fsaid plans to implement corralling
OL,16,Fareas and sterile zones at the station
OL,17,Fwere "like something out of a horrific
OL,18,Fdeath camp", while fellow councillor
OL,19,FRichard Kemp likened the plans to a
OL,20,F"greeting camp at Auschwitz".
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
