OL,3,GNEWSAEverton fans condemn 'death camp'
OL,4,Acomments in station row
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoth councillors have since apologised
OL,7,Ffor "any offence caused by the
OL,8,Fcomments."
OL,10,FIn an open letter, Everton Fan Advisory
OL,11,FBoard described the comments as "deeply
OL,12,Finappropriate, insensitive and entirely
OL,13,Funhelpful."
